WEBVTT

00:06.380 --> 00:09.090
Is it usually this crowded?

00:09.090 --> 00:11.390
This is actually less than usual.

00:11.390 --> 00:12.260
This is less?!

00:12.260 --> 00:17.310
I've only heard the stories from
our customers, but this is amazing!

00:17.310 --> 00:20.270
She's like a kid going to a theme park
for the first time...

00:20.940 --> 00:23.190
Don't get too excited or you'll get lost.

00:23.190 --> 00:25.900
I-I'm not overexcited!

00:26.820 --> 00:28.530
Let's finish our business first.

00:28.530 --> 00:31.910
After that, we can use the rest
of the time freely, right?

00:32.160 --> 00:33.160
You're right!

00:33.660 --> 00:36.660
Then let's hurry to the guild!

00:41.670 --> 00:42.380
(The Moon Sanctum)

00:42.380 --> 00:46.050
The fact she was scared
to go outside feels like a lie.

00:47.300 --> 00:50.840
By the way, do you know
where the guild is?

00:52.220 --> 00:53.300
Umm...

00:54.850 --> 00:56.970
- This way.
- W-wait, hold up!

01:05.860 --> 01:11.070
♪Pierce through the world That laugh at ideas♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.750
♪We've arrived today carrying Something that is unnamed♪

01:27.800 --> 01:32.800
♪All of it cannot be Described by mere words♪

01:32.800 --> 01:36.760
♪We cannot accept that Tomorrow is the future♪

01:37.430 --> 01:41.520
♪For we do not have a way to Somehow put it into shape♪

01:41.520 --> 01:46.360
♪Gather the pieces of the broken heart♪

01:46.360 --> 01:50.860
♪And take back our voices♪

01:51.070 --> 01:54.530
♪Never let go of this hand you've grasped♪

01:54.530 --> 01:56.830
♪Because it's on the verge of disappearing♪

01:56.830 --> 02:00.620
♪Aah, please remain the way you are♪

02:00.620 --> 02:03.960
♪Even if the times is Accelerated by cruelty♪

02:03.960 --> 02:06.630
♪Even if your dream is disappearing♪

02:06.630 --> 02:09.960
♪Never give up the beat of your heart♪

02:09.960 --> 02:14.760
♪With the independence we've finally
Gained after falling many times♪

02:14.760 --> 02:19.970
♪Pierce through the world That laugh at ideas♪

02:43.620 --> 02:45.540
The ranking up is done.

02:45.540 --> 02:48.170
(Guild card, Shin, Adventurer, Rank E)
From now on, you are Rank E.

02:48.170 --> 02:53.130
Huh? But I haven't
finished a single quest yet.

02:53.130 --> 02:56.380
You've defeated a high-level Skullface

02:56.380 --> 03:01.180
and a massive skullface outbreak.

03:01.180 --> 03:06.190
Your report during our guild's survey
has been proven right.

03:06.190 --> 03:10.310
As a reward, we grant you a promotion.

03:10.310 --> 03:12.570
Ah, so that's what happened.

03:12.570 --> 03:16.820
Personally, you should be Rank A.

03:16.820 --> 03:21.580
But a sudden increase in rank won't be
well-received by other adventurers.

03:21.830 --> 03:22.870
By the way,

03:22.870 --> 03:26.640
what kind of relationship do
you have with this person?

03:26.640 --> 03:30.310
Things happened and
we now end up journeying together.

03:30.310 --> 03:31.840
Since I'm going to the guild anyway,

03:32.230 --> 03:36.090
we thought of signing her as an adventurer
and getting her guild card too.

03:36.840 --> 03:38.090
Lover.

03:38.890 --> 03:40.340
Y-you're wrong!

03:40.340 --> 03:43.010
But you were holding hands like one.

03:43.010 --> 03:45.850
H-how do you know?!
The information spreads too fast!

03:45.850 --> 03:50.480
You're beautiful, after all.
Men just can't resist.

03:50.480 --> 03:53.650
Why do your words have
thorns in them?

03:54.740 --> 03:59.120
Holding hands with a beautiful woman
must have felt like a dream.

03:59.120 --> 04:03.920
There is no shame in being intimate
in the middle of the streets.

04:03.920 --> 04:06.080
I think it's inevitable.

04:06.080 --> 04:08.620
This is bad. I've flipped some
strange switch in her!

04:09.070 --> 04:13.780
By the way, is there any information
about the Holy Land?

04:13.790 --> 04:15.130
Holy Land, is it?

04:15.130 --> 04:19.550
Yes, the one said to be destroyed
during the Sunset on Prosperity.

04:19.550 --> 04:21.260
I am very sorry,

04:21.260 --> 04:26.850
but only B rank or above that can acquire
information about the Holy Land.

04:26.850 --> 04:28.730
Is that so...?

04:28.730 --> 04:33.510
I'm just kind of interested, so I will
ask you again after raising my rank.

04:33.510 --> 04:35.520
Oh, right, I'm going to Farnid,

04:35.520 --> 04:39.280
is there any quest I can do
while going there?

04:39.530 --> 04:41.030
About that...

04:43.820 --> 04:47.280
Umm, in the direction of Farnid...

04:47.280 --> 04:47.290
Umm, in the direction of Farnid...
(Quest: Bayreun, Carriage Escort)
There's a quest to escort a horse
carriage to Bayreun, a transit point.

04:47.290 --> 04:48.500
(Quest: Bayreun, Carriage Escort)
There's a quest to escort a horse
carriage to Bayreun, a transit point.

04:48.500 --> 04:49.500
(Quest Giver: Nakk)
There's a quest to escort a horse
carriage to Bayreun, a transit point.

04:49.500 --> 04:50.590
(Number of People: Maximum Five)
There's a quest to escort a horse
carriage to Bayreun, a transit point.

04:50.590 --> 04:51.660
(Rewards: 10 Silver Per Person)
There's a quest to escort a horse
carriage to Bayreun, a transit point.

04:51.670 --> 04:53.670
Oh, sounds great.

04:54.210 --> 04:57.380
- What about it, Tiera?
- I don't mind.

04:57.380 --> 04:58.550
I understand.

04:59.050 --> 05:03.090
The departure is today at noon
when the bell rings three times.

05:03.090 --> 05:07.470
There are already two other adventurers,
so please join them then.

05:09.790 --> 05:13.710
There's much time left
until the guild card is finished.

05:13.710 --> 05:16.760
The quest time is still by the afternoon.

05:16.760 --> 05:18.320
So let's walk around the city

05:18.320 --> 05:20.440
as we head to the church.

05:20.440 --> 05:21.820
We can?!

05:53.610 --> 05:54.610
Rashia.

05:55.810 --> 05:57.360
Hey, good morning.

05:57.900 --> 06:00.490
Mr. Shin, good morning.

06:00.490 --> 06:01.740
And um...

06:01.740 --> 06:03.740
May I know who might you be?

06:04.530 --> 06:08.120
My name is Tiera.
Pleased to meet you.

06:08.120 --> 06:10.120
Sorry for my late introduction.

06:10.120 --> 06:14.370
I am the sister in this church,
my name is Rashia.

06:14.370 --> 06:16.750
I am the Moon Sanctum's helper...

06:16.750 --> 06:18.590
What?! The Moon Sanctum?!

06:18.590 --> 06:21.630
Then you know Lady Schnee?!

06:21.630 --> 06:23.550
She's my master.

06:23.550 --> 06:26.360
Eh?! That's amazing! Wonderful!

06:26.360 --> 06:28.390
How did you turn into her disciple?

06:28.390 --> 06:31.140
Is Lady Schnee a strict master?

06:31.770 --> 06:35.150
From your perspective,
what kind of person is Lady Schnee...

06:35.900 --> 06:38.310
It's been a while, Yu!

06:39.700 --> 06:42.150
- You're so energetic today, Millie.
- Yeah!

06:42.150 --> 06:44.530
They said the orphanage won't go away!

06:44.530 --> 06:47.380
It's all thanks to you! Thank you!

06:47.380 --> 06:49.160
I see, glad to hear.

06:49.650 --> 06:56.240
Thanks to you, I was appointed as
the next priest of this church.

06:56.240 --> 06:58.540
The kids are all very happy about it.

06:58.540 --> 07:01.250
I can't express my gratitude enough.

07:01.250 --> 07:03.210
Don't worry about it.

07:03.210 --> 07:05.050
That aside, where's Wilhelm?

07:05.050 --> 07:08.010
He's out to check on the priest
from last time.

07:08.010 --> 07:11.720
He said he could not
let things go as it is.

07:11.720 --> 07:13.480
Sounds like him.

07:13.480 --> 07:18.440
We still don't know his objective
in trying to take over the church at all.

07:18.940 --> 07:21.570
I hope nothing bad happens.

07:21.570 --> 07:24.320
Please have this just in case.

07:24.820 --> 07:27.320
- You too, Millie.
- Hmm? What is this?

07:27.950 --> 07:30.200
It has many magic attached to it.

07:30.700 --> 07:33.200
- Think of it as a charm.
- A charm!

07:33.200 --> 07:36.580
Thank you very much for everything.

07:36.580 --> 07:39.210
- Thank you very much.
- It's all right.

07:39.210 --> 07:42.380
Miss! Is it true that Big Bro is coming?

07:42.380 --> 07:43.840
Oh! There he is!

07:43.840 --> 07:46.880
Hey, you guys. You all seem well.

07:46.880 --> 07:48.340
We're great!

07:48.340 --> 07:50.390
Let's play together, Big Bro Shin!

07:50.390 --> 07:51.970
I'll give you candies later, okay?

07:51.970 --> 07:54.470
- Really?
- Yay!

07:54.470 --> 07:56.480
Shin!

07:57.140 --> 07:59.690
Help me!

08:02.060 --> 08:05.110
I let my eyes go for a bit and
you're already close with the kids.

08:06.860 --> 08:10.990
We're sorry the kids troubled you.

08:10.990 --> 08:12.070
No, not at all.

08:12.070 --> 08:17.000
It was my first time dealing with kids,
so initially I didn't know what to do.

08:17.000 --> 08:19.080
But they are so cute and lively.

08:19.080 --> 08:22.960
Yes! I'll protect this
orphanage from the...

08:23.800 --> 08:24.960
Ouch...

08:28.900 --> 08:32.150
This is Lady Tiera's guild card.

08:32.150 --> 08:33.720
Please check it.

08:33.720 --> 08:36.600
(Guild Card: Tiera, Adventurer, Rank G)

08:36.600 --> 08:39.230
So I'm an adventurer too now.

08:39.230 --> 08:42.100
Now, it's about time to take
the Moon Sanctum.

08:42.100 --> 08:44.320
Oh, I totally forgot.

08:44.320 --> 08:46.860
Hey, that's what you
shouldn't forget the most.

08:46.860 --> 08:49.610
It's even stranger to think
of taking a house along!

08:49.610 --> 08:51.030
Oh...

08:51.030 --> 08:56.120
I'm the owner of the Moon Sanctum,
so it's natural to me.

08:57.830 --> 08:59.620
Is that a crystal?!

08:59.620 --> 09:03.900
It's my first to see one so big
and well-produced!

09:03.900 --> 09:07.500
This has a Teleportation attachment to it.

09:07.500 --> 09:10.090
It allows teleportation to
a registered location.

09:10.090 --> 09:11.510
It's disposable, though.

09:11.510 --> 09:15.430
Let's go to the Moon Sanctum with this.

09:15.430 --> 09:19.770
Nothing you bring ever makes sense.

09:19.770 --> 09:22.520
Don't tell me you made this.

09:24.020 --> 09:27.900
What do people think of crystals
with teleportation attachments now?

09:27.900 --> 09:31.030
Teleportation itself is a lost magic.

09:31.030 --> 09:34.120
If you have the ingredients,
you can create as many as you like.

09:34.120 --> 09:35.740
Well, sorry for that.

09:36.280 --> 09:38.160
That's how it is, I guess.

09:38.160 --> 09:40.790
You're the legendary
High Human, after all.

09:41.910 --> 09:46.760
No one is around.
Shall we teleport now?

09:46.760 --> 09:48.670
Sure, do it.

09:49.660 --> 09:50.680
Here we go.

10:00.030 --> 10:02.050
(The Moon Sanctum)

10:02.680 --> 10:04.560
Amazing.

10:04.560 --> 10:06.560
That felt strange.

10:06.560 --> 10:08.470
All right, let's do this.

10:08.470 --> 10:09.690
Right now?

10:12.820 --> 10:13.820
Storage!

10:27.920 --> 10:29.340
Look.

10:29.960 --> 10:31.420
Is that...?

10:31.420 --> 10:34.590
Yeah. This is the Moon Sanctum's
portable mode.

10:35.840 --> 10:37.720
That's amazing.

10:37.720 --> 10:42.600
Well, now that our business is done,
let's go to our quest location.

10:49.570 --> 10:51.110
Excuse me.

10:51.820 --> 10:53.860
Is this Mr. Nakk's carriage?

10:54.480 --> 10:55.570
That's correct.

10:55.570 --> 10:58.550
Are you adventurers
who took the quest too?

10:58.550 --> 11:01.660
Yes. I'll be doing it with you.

11:01.660 --> 11:04.080
I'm Shin, and this is...

11:04.080 --> 11:06.620
Tiera. Nice to meet you.

11:06.620 --> 11:08.000
I see.

11:08.000 --> 11:11.340
I'm Gaien. We'll be working with you.

11:11.340 --> 11:12.630
And here is...

11:16.430 --> 11:18.640
Tsubaki. Nice to meet you.

11:19.140 --> 11:20.860
Yeah, me too.

11:20.860 --> 11:22.180
Nice to meet you too.

11:22.180 --> 11:24.640
So everyone is here already!

11:24.640 --> 11:27.100
I am Nakk, the merchant!

11:27.100 --> 11:29.150
I'll be counting on you until Bayreun!

11:29.150 --> 11:31.020
H-hello.

11:40.030 --> 11:42.030
Everyone is in?

11:42.030 --> 11:44.410
All right, let's go!

11:51.670 --> 11:54.050
The Moon Sanctum disappeared?

11:54.630 --> 11:56.130
Are you sure about that?

11:56.130 --> 11:59.430
Yes. It's just as reported, My King.

12:01.390 --> 12:05.430
It's an immovable building that has
existed since the Sunset of Prosperity.

12:06.430 --> 12:09.940
(The Moon Sanctum)
No matter how strong someone is,
not a single man can conquer it.

12:09.940 --> 12:13.230
No high-level monster could
invade it either.

12:13.230 --> 12:16.570
It's a secret shop made by
a long-lost technology.

12:17.450 --> 12:23.780
Its disappearance will turn into a problem
beyond the Bayrelicht Kingdom.

12:24.450 --> 12:27.710
What about Lady Schnee Raizar?
Do you have anything about her?

12:28.080 --> 12:31.210
There is a report that
she's heading to the castle.

12:31.210 --> 12:35.500
If the report is true,
she will arrive within the day.

12:36.360 --> 12:38.220
Rionne has yet to return as well.

12:38.670 --> 12:41.340
We know too little to make any decision.

12:41.340 --> 12:45.140
Father, I suggest you
wait for Lady Raizar's arrival.

12:45.810 --> 12:48.350
Yes, you're right.

12:49.940 --> 12:52.730
So, have you guys ever
killed a person before?

12:52.730 --> 12:53.980
Huh?

12:54.570 --> 12:57.860
In an escort mission,
you may fight humans.

12:58.400 --> 13:02.200
Or rather, there's a greater chance of
being attacked by bandits over monsters.

13:03.370 --> 13:06.620
Most people underestimate me
because of my appearance,

13:06.620 --> 13:09.250
but I've smacked many of such men.

13:09.250 --> 13:11.840
Oh, that's encouraging.

13:11.840 --> 13:16.500
Right! It's better to know
the extent of each other's ability,

13:16.500 --> 13:19.380
so why don't we reintroduce ourselves?

13:19.380 --> 13:20.130
Right.

13:20.630 --> 13:23.530
My class is a samurai.

13:23.530 --> 13:25.590
I am a rank-A adventurer.

13:25.590 --> 13:29.140
I'm not as skilled in magic
so don't depend on me for that.

13:29.140 --> 13:32.730
I am a brawler, rank E.

13:32.730 --> 13:35.400
I can use support magic
to enhance speed.

13:35.400 --> 13:40.430
For a start, I am an alchemist,
but I can use a bow and sword.

13:40.430 --> 13:43.660
I just became an adventurer
so my rank is G,

13:43.660 --> 13:46.330
but I can do simple healing magic,

13:46.330 --> 13:48.910
so just ask me if you need help.

13:48.910 --> 13:53.460
I'm a samurai just like Gaien.
My rank is E.

13:53.460 --> 13:56.680
I can use a bit of lightning
and fire magic.

13:56.680 --> 13:58.670
And this is Yuzuha.

13:58.670 --> 14:00.630
Despite its looks, it's a real monster.

14:01.250 --> 14:02.750
I made a tamer contract with it.

14:04.840 --> 14:07.840
So you're a samurai that
can use magic, huh?

14:07.840 --> 14:10.680
You must have undergone
extreme training for that.

14:11.230 --> 14:14.120
It's also very rare to be
liked by monsters.

14:14.120 --> 14:16.750
By the way, Yuzuha is surprisingly strong.

14:18.660 --> 14:20.570
Are you from Hinomoto?

14:21.850 --> 14:24.070
I'm not, but why do you think so?

14:24.070 --> 14:27.310
Most samurai are from Hinomoto.

14:27.310 --> 14:30.040
This is my first time
meeting one other than Gaien.

14:30.040 --> 14:31.580
Huh, is that so?

14:31.580 --> 14:35.420
Most people want to be warriors
or knights, then specialized classes.

14:35.420 --> 14:38.420
Those who become samurai
are mostly weirdos.

14:38.420 --> 14:40.250
Weirdos?! No way!

14:40.250 --> 14:43.050
It's a great class that can
ambush from walls!

14:43.050 --> 14:48.640
It's ridiculous having to train as a knight
and a berserker class as a prerequisite.

14:48.640 --> 14:50.220
Oh, that...

14:50.220 --> 14:52.270
I see what you mean,

14:52.270 --> 14:54.140
but to say frankly, it's strong, okay?

14:54.140 --> 14:55.480
I agree with that.

14:55.480 --> 14:57.560
But it's still weird.

14:57.560 --> 15:01.980
It's true that Hinomoto with its many
samurai is a unique island country.

15:02.900 --> 15:06.110
As an island formed due to
the shifting of the earth's crust,

15:06.110 --> 15:09.950
there were many samurai
and ninja guild bases.

15:10.740 --> 15:14.330
Those people became the center
of the country's formation.

15:14.330 --> 15:17.460
In Hinomoto, those who want to be combatants

15:17.460 --> 15:20.000
have adoration towards samurai.

15:20.500 --> 15:23.670
What's the name of the guilds
who created Hinomoto?

15:23.670 --> 15:26.800
The ones known by the public
are Kachofugetsu,

15:26.800 --> 15:29.600
Majin Keppuroku, and Kuromiko Shrine.

15:29.600 --> 15:31.140
W-what...?

15:31.680 --> 15:36.270
It's hard to believe the guilds from back
in the game would form a country.

15:36.270 --> 15:41.400
There seem to be other small guilds,
but they're not well known.

15:41.400 --> 15:45.400
I get the picture.
Thank you for all the information.

15:46.950 --> 15:48.660
What's wrong, Sir Nakk?

15:54.700 --> 15:56.540
Are all of you bandits?

15:56.540 --> 15:59.040
Sorry there, Merchant.

15:59.040 --> 16:03.300
If you don't want to die, you'd better
leave all your money and belongings.

16:05.260 --> 16:07.550
- Stay in the carriage, Mr. Nakk.
- Okay.

16:08.260 --> 16:10.600
Yuzuha, protect Mr. Nakk.

16:15.310 --> 16:18.690
What to do?
They don't look that many.

16:18.690 --> 16:22.690
We'll retaliate if they attack us.

16:30.200 --> 16:33.410
So, have you guys ever
killed a person before?

16:36.620 --> 16:37.790
I must do it.

16:38.540 --> 16:42.290
Or else, those three in the front
will face more danger.

16:42.290 --> 16:45.880
Hey, hey, you three wanna fight us?

16:45.880 --> 16:50.180
Why don't you also leave
that red lady behind?

16:51.510 --> 16:54.180
We can have loads of fun with her.

16:55.180 --> 16:58.180
I'll make you scream
and cry to no end.

16:58.180 --> 17:02.190
I'm the type that can't get aroused
without some screams.

17:02.190 --> 17:06.570
Poor girl, he won't kill you so easily.

17:06.570 --> 17:10.570
You'd even beg to be killed fast.

17:10.570 --> 17:14.580
It's not like it'd change
anything by that though.

17:15.620 --> 17:16.330
Shin?

17:17.080 --> 17:19.330
He's different than usual.

17:19.330 --> 17:21.650
That killing intent is dangerous.

17:21.650 --> 17:23.830
That Shin is dangerous!

17:31.590 --> 17:35.720
Attacking a person is scary, however...

17:36.160 --> 17:37.870
I must do it.

17:39.470 --> 17:41.480
I don't want to kill unnecessarily.

17:41.480 --> 17:44.840
You can walk away now, or else...

17:44.840 --> 17:45.610
I'll kill you!

17:45.610 --> 17:48.400
Now, now, can't you see the situation?

17:48.400 --> 17:52.110
We know that most of you
are ranked E or lower.

17:53.990 --> 17:59.580
No matter if you're an A rank,
you can't fight while protecting everyone.

17:59.580 --> 18:01.330
They know us...

18:01.870 --> 18:04.580
So it's not a coincidental encounter.

18:04.580 --> 18:07.250
I want to know where
they get the information.

18:07.250 --> 18:09.130
We can force it out of them.

18:09.130 --> 18:11.670
- What?
- How troublesome.

18:11.670 --> 18:14.430
Just mince those other than the girl.

18:14.430 --> 18:17.430
Yeah, they won't yap once they're dead.

18:21.470 --> 18:22.980
- What?!
- What?!

18:25.350 --> 18:27.110
How did they see our hidden members?!

18:33.490 --> 18:35.910
You guys! Get them!

18:39.950 --> 18:41.910
Just one? You're underestimating me.

18:41.910 --> 18:44.410
Don't struggle too much.

18:44.410 --> 18:46.880
If I get you killed,
we can't have our fun!

18:47.250 --> 18:48.500
So annoying.

18:50.880 --> 18:54.380
Flash of Vitality? That's not E-rank level!

18:54.380 --> 18:55.590
Fly away!

19:00.560 --> 19:01.430
What?

19:01.430 --> 19:04.310
You idiot! Don't look away!

19:12.610 --> 19:14.070
Sorry for cutting you down.

19:14.070 --> 19:16.200
He can cut the sword too?

19:16.200 --> 19:22.830
You may have magic swords,
but unfortunately, mine is too.

19:25.340 --> 19:26.460
That won't happen.

19:32.380 --> 19:34.210
Who the hell are they?!

19:34.210 --> 19:37.590
Other than the Dragnil,
they are supposedly ranked E or lower!

19:37.590 --> 19:40.970
Our levels should be higher,
and we have the swords too!

19:40.970 --> 19:42.100
And yet...!

19:43.100 --> 19:45.480
Now, what shall we do with you?

19:47.980 --> 19:50.730
Anyway, that sword is a nuisance.

19:54.480 --> 19:55.740
Wha...?

19:57.780 --> 20:01.240
I'll make you immobile and we're done.

20:01.240 --> 20:03.870
Huh? No, wait. Stop!

20:09.130 --> 20:11.340
I-is it over?

20:17.420 --> 20:19.090
That's pretty impressive.

20:19.090 --> 20:20.890
I was holding myself back, though.

20:20.890 --> 20:23.890
You guys are impossible.
This is ridiculous!

20:23.890 --> 20:25.770
I will definitely kill you!

20:25.770 --> 20:28.270
Just enjoy your time now because...

20:29.770 --> 20:34.020
We will have you spill out
who your informant is.

20:38.100 --> 20:39.220
Shin!

20:39.900 --> 20:40.980
Shin!

20:49.870 --> 20:52.420
Uh, what are you doing?

20:52.420 --> 20:53.900
Just a sec.

20:54.710 --> 20:56.420
Hey, don't move.

20:58.720 --> 21:01.430
E-excuse me, Tiera?

21:04.870 --> 21:07.670
Sorry... What's this for?

21:09.820 --> 21:11.190
You're back.

21:14.190 --> 21:15.320
Okay, good.

21:20.170 --> 21:22.130
What's that just now?

21:22.130 --> 21:23.450
Dunno.

21:26.330 --> 21:28.830
What was I doing?!

21:29.740 --> 21:31.580
Shin from a while ago

21:31.580 --> 21:35.210
was so cold and dark.

21:35.880 --> 21:38.630
Did he not realize it?

21:38.630 --> 21:40.630
Or is it just me?

21:41.590 --> 21:45.970
In the past, Master did the same thing
and it calmed me down.

21:45.970 --> 21:48.640
So I just naturally did that to Shin, but...

21:54.980 --> 22:00.030
Ah, now I don't know how
I should face him later!

22:01.350 --> 22:03.730
- What's that?
- Dunno.

22:16.380 --> 22:23.130
♪In the midst of the journey of
Neverending dreams♪

22:23.130 --> 22:28.470
♪I tried peeking
Through the yet-unseen future♪

22:28.470 --> 22:35.100
♪Whether the thing that lies
There is the smile of my friends♪

22:35.100 --> 22:41.190
♪Or is it despair and fury,
I've yet to know♪

22:41.190 --> 22:47.120
♪No matter how passionately
I wished for it♪

22:47.120 --> 22:52.370
♪I cannot return to the past♪

22:53.040 --> 22:58.710
♪So I will at least this hand mine now♪

22:58.710 --> 23:03.010
♪To build through the future♪

23:04.630 --> 23:10.720
♪In the lands so far away that
I will one day reach♪

23:10.720 --> 23:16.560
♪I'm sure there will be many
Great happiness waiting♪

23:16.560 --> 23:22.610
♪For all the smiles that always
Overflows this heart of mine♪

23:22.610 --> 23:28.370
♪I wish to protect them all,
So I aimed to the skies♪

23:28.370 --> 23:34.160
♪And build over an unwavering path♪

23:35.000 --> 23:39.960
(Next time, Episode 7: Bayreun)
